  <\/div>\n        <div class=\"child-c\">\n          <h3>Pay Per Click (PPC)<\/h3>\n          <p>Our PPC management services are designed to drive results from the first click. We structure campaigns around conversion goals, optimizing bidding strategies, ad extensions, and match types.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"child-c\">\n          <h3>eCommerce Marketing<\/h3>\n          <p>We develop product-focused campaigns that convert. Our strategies are built on category performance, buyer behavior, and real-time bidding adjustments.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"child-c\">\n          <h3>eCommerce PPC<\/h3>\n          <p>We use dynamic remarketing and real-time inventory syncing to target modern online shoppers. Our product feeds include pricing, stock, and key selling points.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"child-c\">\n          <h3>Google PPC Ads<\/h3>\n          <p>We build optimized campaigns for Search, Display, and Shopping, focusing on intent matching, relevance, quality scores, and high CTR ad extensions.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"child-c\">\n          <h3>Bing PPC Ads<\/h3>\n          <p>Bing Ads are built with platform-specific insights. We optimize copy, bidding, and audience targeting for high-value desktop or business-user traffic.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"child-c\">\n          <h3>Yelp Ads<\/h3>\n          <p>For location-based services, Yelp ads give immediate intent visibility. We manage keywords, listings, and budgets to maximize local lead generation.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"child-c\">\n          <h3>Remarketing Ads<\/h3>\n          <p>We design re-engagement campaigns for abandoned carts, product views, and site activity\u2014serving ads across Google Display, YouTube, and apps.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"child-c\">\n          <h3>Center Shopping<\/h3>\n          <p>We use optimized feeds, segmented ad groups, and value-based bidding to deliver visual product ads across Google Shopping and maximize ROI.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<script>\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {\n        const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.tab');\n        const contents = document.querySelectorAll('.child-c');\n\n        function clearActiveStates() {\n            tabs.forEach(tab => tab.classList.remove('scrolled'));\n            contents.forEach(content => content.classList.remove('active'));\n        }\n\n        tabs.forEach((tab, index) => {\n            tab.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                clearActiveStates();\n                tab.classList.add('scrolled');\n                contents[index].classList.add('active');\n            });\n        });\n\n        \/\/ Optional: Highlight the visible tab on scroll\n        window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {\n            const firstVisible = [...tabs].findIndex(tab => {\n                const rect = tab.getBoundingClientRect();\n                return rect.top >= 200 && rect.bottom <= window.innerHeight;\n            });\n\n            if (firstVisible !== -1) {\n                clearActiveStates();\n                tabs[firstVisible].classList.add('scrolled');\n                contents[firstVisible].classList.add('active');\n            }\n        });\n    });\n<\/script>\n<\/body>\n<\/html>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-83f2e71 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"83f2e71\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t