isabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-523eb44 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"523eb44\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-798399b\" data-id=\"798399b\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-47d85cd elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"47d85cd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><span>SEM<\/span> Process and Strategy\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c332b5f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c332b5f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our search engine marketing services are driven by process, precision, and performance. We don\u2019t just run ads, we build structured campaigns that align with your brand goals and speak directly to the intent of your target audience. Our strategy is rooted in real-time analytics, deep keyword targeting, and ongoing testing, ensuring that your business is positioned for continuous growth. From planning to performance tracking, each component of our SEM services is designed to generate high-quality leads, lower cost per click, and drive measurable return on investment.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-3ced2f7\" data-id=\"3ced2f7\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-225fb1b elementor-widget elementor-widget-eael-content-timeline\" data-id=\"225fb1b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"eael-content-timeline.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"eael-content-timeline-225fb1b\" class=\"content-timeline-layout-right date-position-inside horizontal-timeline-wrapper\" data-slide_to_scroll=\"{&quot;desktop&quot;:1,&quot;tablet&quot;:1,&quot;mobile&quot;:1}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"eael-content-timeline-container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"eael-content-timeline-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"eael-content-timeline-block\">\n    <div class=\"eael-content-timeline-line\">\n        <div class=\"eael-content-timeline-inner\"><\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"eael-content-timeline-img eael-picture \"><\/div><div class=\"eael-content-timeline-content\"><h2 class=\"eael-timeline-title\"><a href=\"\">Campaign Strategy<\/a><\/h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">We begin each campaign with a strategy that\u2019s grounded in business data and user behavior. As a full-service search engine marketing agency, we identify who your audience is, what they\u2019re searching for, and how they behave throughout the buying journey. This includes segmenting users by device, location, intent level, and previous behavior, ensuring that your ads show up in front of the right people at the right time.\u00a0<\/span><\/p><span class=\"eael-date\"><\/span><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"eael-content-timeline-block\">\n    <div class=\"eael-content-timeline-line\">\n        <div class=\"eael-content-timeline-inner\"><\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"eael-content-timeline-img eael-picture \"><\/div><div class=\"eael-content-timeline-content\"><h2 class=\"eael-timeline-title\"><a href=\"\">Keyword Research<\/a><\/h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Effective keyword selection is one of the most critical steps in SEM marketing. We conduct deep keyword analysis to uncover opportunities based on user intent, cost efficiency, and search volume. Our process includes building negative keyword lists, identifying brand-safe terms, and organizing keyword groups around funnel stages. Long-tail keywords are essential for capturing lower-competition, high-conversion traffic, while broad matches are handled with strict modifiers to avoid irrelevant clicks.\u00a0<\/span><\/p><span class=\"eael-date\"><\/span><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"eael-content-timeline-block\">\n    <div class=\"eael-content-timeline-line\">\n        <div class=\"eael-content-timeline-inner\"><\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"eael-content-timeline-img eael-picture \"><\/div><div class=\"eael-content-timeline-content\"><h2 class=\"eael-timeline-title\"><a href=\"\">A\/B Testing<\/a><\/h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Testing is not optional in high-performing SEM services, it\u2019s essential. We deploy structured A\/B testing across ad headlines, descriptions, display URLs, sitelinks, and landing page content. By analyzing real-time data, we determine which variations are outperforming others and optimize accordingly. This testing applies not only to creative elements but also to bidding strategies, geographic targeting, and scheduling.\u00a0<\/span><\/p><span class=\"eael-date\"><\/span><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"eael-content-timeline-block\">\n    <div class=\"eael-content-timeline-line\">\n        <div class=\"eael-content-timeline-inner\"><\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"eael-content-timeline-img eael-picture \"><\/div><div class=\"eael-content-timeline-content\"><h2 class=\"eael-timeline-title\"><a href=\"\">Tracking &amp; Tools<\/a><\/h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Transparency and performance go hand-in-hand. We implement comprehensive tracking frameworks that monitor user behavior from initial impression to post-conversion actions. Many of our clients benefit from aligning their SEM efforts with broader<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/digitalsoftwarelabs.com\/digital-marketing\/\"> <span style=\"font-weight: 400\">digital marketing<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> initiatives. By structuring tracking across channels, we ensure that every touchpoint, whether it\u2019s paid search, email, or social, is working together toward your overall business objectives.<\/span><\/p><span class=\"eael-date\"><\/span><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-feb9545 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"feb9545\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-01e0ea1\" data-id=\"01e0ea1\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-3c0e938 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-de